    "title": "Marlboro County Sheriff's Office conducting a drug search warrant - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sebastian Fall ,\n1 hours ago\nMARLBORO COUNTY, S.C. (WBTW)-- The Marlboro County Sheriff's Office is currently executing a drug search warrant on Delta Nights Road, according to their Facebook.\nOn their Facebook page, at around 10 p.m., the Marlboro County Sheriff's Office announced that they are currently investigating a property for drugs. The residence is located on Delta Nights Road in the Wallace area.\nThey reported that a distraction device was deployed as part of the operation. There is no threat to the public, and the scene is secure.\nAdditional information will be released when it becomes available. Count on News13 for updates.\n* * *\nSebastian Fall is a Digital Producer at News13. He is from Akron, Ohio, and joined the News13 team in September 2026. He graduated from Coastal Carolina University in December 2025. Follow Sebastian on Instagram , and read more of his work here .\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed.\nFor the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to WBTW.\nAdd to Preferred Sources\n1",
